OL,3,GNEWSASex abuse teacher arrested for    
OL,4,Amissing sentencing                     
OL,6,FPolice have arrested a teacher         
OL,7,Fconvicted of sexually abusing two      
OL,8,Fpupils at an all-boys school in the    
OL,9,Flate 1980s after she failed to turn up 
OL,10,Ffor her sentencing hearing.            
OL,12,FSally-Anne Bowen, who taught chemistry 
OL,13,Fat Christ's College in Finchley, north 
OL,14,FLondon, was in her 20s when she had sex
OL,15,Fwith one pupil up to 30 times and      
OL,16,Fkissed a second boy while the pupils   
OL,17,Fwere aged about 14 or 15.              
OL,19,FHer trial heard she wore short tight   
OL,20,Fskirts and flirted in class, with one  
OL,21,Fformer pupil comparing her behaviour to
OL,22,F"a Sabrina Carpenter video".           
